{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "d4f92a13-cc81-4b7e-9f21-3e7a1c08b4d9",
		"name": "Zenova Meal API v2 — Dislike, Undo & Alternatives",
		"description": "Postman Collection for Zenova backend meal endpoints (v2):\n1. Dislike a meal plan item (marks isDisliked + auto-suggests alternative)\n2. Dislike a meal log entry\n3. Undo delete of a meal plan item (restore soft-deleted meal)\n4. Get suggested alternative meals (read-only, no commit)\n\nAlso includes all existing meal endpoints for full coverage:\n- Generate / get meal plan (daily & weekly)\n- Log a meal\n- Get meal logs\n- Nutrition summary\n- Like / favorite\n- Delete meal plan item\n- Delete meal log\n- Regenerate / redo a meal item\n- Generate grocery list\n- Get favorite meals",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
